(https://github.com/alexta69/metube), copyright the MeTube contributors,
licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0. MediaHarvest is
released under the same license; see LICENSE.

Changes from MeTube began on 2026-11-10 and are recorded in this repository's
git history. They include a format picker and link preview, re-encoding to the
chosen audio bitrate, lyrics lookup, video subtitles, a disk-space check,
a reworked interface and branding, checksum-pinned image builds, installers,
and a new CI and release pipeline.

The Mono theme bundles JetBrains Mono (copyright the JetBrains Mono Project
Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1) and icons from pixelarticons (copyright
Gerrit Halfmann, MIT License). Their licences are in ui/src/mono/.

The Android app (android/) uses the same font and icons, and is built with
youtubedl-android (https://github.com/JunkFood02/youtubedl-android, GNU General
Public License v3.0), which bundles yt-dlp (Unlicense), Python (PSF License),
FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL) and QuickJS (MIT License). It also uses AndroidX and Jetpack
Compose (Apache License 2.0), Kotlin (Apache License 2.0), Jackson (Apache
License 2.0) and Apache Commons IO and Compress (Apache License 2.0).
